# monitoring/secrets/metrics_token holds the raw METRICS_TOKEN value and
# nothing else (no comments, no "METRICS_TOKEN=" prefix). Prometheus sends it
# as "Authorization: Bearer <token>" when scraping the backend.
#
# Don't edit it by hand: ./scripts/monitoring-init.sh copies METRICS_TOKEN from
# backend/.env into it, or creates an empty file when the token isn't set
# (the backend leaves /metrics open then). The real file is gitignored.
